WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.086
The stars faded and the sun rose.

2
00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:12.331
The dew sparkled on the grass.

3
00:00:12.332 --> 00:00:16.234
"Good morning," said Rat, waking.

4
00:00:16.235 --> 00:00:19.934
"Good morning," said Mole.

5
00:00:19.935 --> 00:00:25.599
Toad was still sleeping and snoring.

6
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.483
"Well," said Rat, "there are chores to do."

7
00:00:30.484 --> 00:00:35.987
Mole fed the horse and Rat got the dishes out.

8
00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:40.808
Together they collected firewood.

9
00:00:40.809 --> 00:00:45.834
Rat started a fire and Mole cooked breakfast.

10
00:00:45.835 --> 00:00:50.057
Finally the smell of coffee woke Toad.

11
00:00:50.058 --> 00:00:54.001
"Ah," said Toad, stretching.

12
00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:56.742
"Isn’t it great?

13
00:00:56.743 --> 00:01:01.312
There are no chores to do on the road!"

14
00:01:01.313 --> 00:01:06.293
"That’s true for people who sleep too late," grumbled Rat.

15
00:01:06.294 --> 00:01:09.512
But Toad didn’t hear him.

16
00:01:09.513 --> 00:01:15.007
He was too busy eating.

17
00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:21.034
"I’m ready. Let’s go!" cried Toad after breakfast.

18
00:01:21.035 --> 00:01:24.200
Mole and Rat got into the cart.

19
00:01:24.201 --> 00:01:29.330
Toad tied the horse to the cart, and they started off.

20
00:01:29.331 --> 00:01:33.160
The dusty road led through a meadow.

21
00:01:33.161 --> 00:01:37.654
"Do you hear that noise?" asked Toad.

22
00:01:37.655 --> 00:01:41.388
"It’s coming from behind us," said Mole.

23
00:01:41.389 --> 00:01:44.310
They all looked.

24
00:01:44.311 --> 00:01:49.576
A cloud of dust was coming up fast.

25
00:01:49.577 --> 00:01:52.448
Vroom! Vroom!

26
00:01:52.449 --> 00:01:56.567
"Oh no!" cried Rat. "Look out!"

27
00:01:56.568 --> 00:02:00.325
A blast of wind zoomed past.

28
00:02:00.326 --> 00:02:04.070
Vroom! Vroom!

29
00:02:04.071 --> 00:02:10.043
"Ahh!" they screamed.

30
00:02:10.044 --> 00:02:15.764
The cart tipped and fell over into a ditch.

31
00:02:15.765 --> 00:02:18.282
The dust cleared.

32
00:02:18.283 --> 00:02:26.935
Ahead, a big, beautiful car raced down the road!

